# Database Design

Main entities:

- Users
- Members
- Departments
- Services
- Attendance
- Visitors
- Follow-ups
- Events

Important relationship:

```text
Department
      │
      └────── Members

Service
      │
      └────── Attendance

Member
      │
      └────── Attendance

Visitor
      │
      └────── Follow-ups
```

Attendance has a unique constraint:

```text
(serviceId, memberId)
```

which prevents duplicate attendance records.

